    {
      "page": 1,
      "order": 55,
      "text": "I certify under penalty of false statement that I am blind, or a person who has a disability that limits or impairs the ability to walk, as described in Part B, or a veteran with PTSD and a",
      "rect": {
        "left": 19,
        "bottom": 428.36,
        "right": 580.41,
        "top": 435.36
      }
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "order": 56,
      "text": "disability defined in C below, or I am the parent or guardian of such person and certifying such condition on his or her behalf. If a Power of Attorney is submitted, it must be attached to",
      "rect": {
        "left": 19,
        "bottom": 420.33,
        "right": 585.11,
        "top": 427.33
      }
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "order": 57,
      "text": "this application.",
      "rect": {
