        "top": 395.46
      }
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "order": 63,
      "text": "PART B - COMPLETED BY PHYSICIAN, APRN, PHYSICIAN ASSISTANT, OPTOMETRIST, OPHTHALMOLOGIST, BESB OR USDVA PSYCHIATRIST",
      "rect": {
        "left": 19,
        "bottom": 374.16,
        "right": 503.93,
        "top": 382.16
      }
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "order": 64,
      "text": "If completed by USDVA psychiatrist, you are also certifying that the person is a veteran as defined in CGS section 27-103(a) and has one or more physical disabilities that limit or impair",
      "rect": {
        "left": 19,
        "bottom": 365.92,
        "right": 588.56,
        "top": 372.92
      }
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "order": 65,
      "text": "the ability to walk as defined in #B 1 through 6 of the criteria below.",
      "rect": {
        "left": 19,
        "bottom": 357.89,
        "right": 226.38,
        "top": 364.89
      }
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "order": 66,
      "text": "CRITERIA TO QUALIFY",
      "rect": {
        "left": 19,
        "bottom": 343.6,
        "right": 129.56,
        "top": 353.6
      }
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "order": 67,
      "text": "The applicant may obtain a placard if they meet one or more of the following conditions:",
      "rect": {
        "left": 28,
        "bottom": 328.85,
        "right": 337.48,
        "top": 336.85
      }
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "order": 68,
      "text": "A.The applicant is blind (Must be certified by an optometrist, ophthalmologist or by Board of Education and Services for the Blind- BESB); OR",
      "rect": {
        "left": 28,
        "bottom": 319.85,
        "right": 529.55,
        "top": 327.85
      }
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "order": 69,
      "text": "B. The applicant has a disability that limits or impairs their ability to walk. These conditions are defined in 23 CFR 1235.2 and are listed below (Must be",
      "rect": {
        "left": 28,
        "bottom": 301.85,
        "right": 564.66,
        "top": 309.85
      }
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "order": 70,
      "text": "certified by Physician, Physician Assistant or Advance Practice Registered Nurse- APRN):",
      "rect": {
        "left": 28,
        "bottom": 292.85,
